---@field per_page? number Number of results per page. Paging is disabled if parameter not sent. Default: <code>50</code>. Max value: <code>100</code>
---@field sort? string Field to use for sorting appended with <code>:1</code> for ascending and <code>:-1</code> for descending. e.g. <code>date:-1</code>
---@field fields? string Comma-separated list of fields to include or exclude (based on value provided for <code>include_fields</code>) in the result. Leave empty to retrieve all fields.
