---Flags used to change the behavior of this tenant.
---@class auth0.TenantSettingsFlags
---@field change_pwd_flow_v1? boolean Whether to use the older v1 change password flow (true, not recommended except for backward compatibility) or the newer safer flow (false, recommended).
---@field enable_apis_section? boolean Whether the APIs section is enabled (true) or disabled (false).
---@field disable_impersonation? boolean Whether the impersonation functionality has been disabled (true) or not (false). Read-only.
---@field enable_client_connections? boolean Whether all current connections should be enabled when a new client (application) is created (true, default) or not (false).
---@field enable_pipeline2? boolean Whether advanced API Authorization scenarios are enabled (true) or disabled (false).
---@field allow_legacy_delegation_grant_types? boolean If enabled, clients are able to add legacy delegation grants.
---@field allow_legacy_ro_grant_types? boolean If enabled, clients are able to add legacy RO grants.
---@field allow_legacy_tokeninfo_endpoint? boolean Whether the legacy `/tokeninfo` endpoint is enabled for your account (true) or unavailable (false).
---@field enable_legacy_profile? boolean Whether ID tokens and the userinfo endpoint includes a complete user profile (true) or only OpenID Connect claims (false).
---@field enable_idtoken_api2? boolean Whether ID tokens can be used to authorize some types of requests to API v2 (true) not not (false).
---@field enable_public_signup_user_exists_error? boolean Whether the public sign up process shows a user_exists error (true) or a generic error (false) if the user already exists.
---@field enable_sso? boolean Whether users are prompted to confirm log in before SSO redirection (false) or are not prompted (true).
---@field allow_changing_enable_sso? boolean Whether the `enable_sso` setting can be changed (true) or not (false).
---@field disable_clickjack_protection_headers? boolean Whether classic Universal Login prompts include additional security headers to prevent clickjacking (true) or no safeguard (false).
---@field no_disclose_enterprise_connections? boolean Do not Publish Enterprise Connections Information with IdP domains on the lock configuration file.
---@field enforce_client_authentication_on_passwordless_start? boolean Enforce client authentication for passwordless start.
---@field enable_adfs_waad_email_verification? boolean Enables the email verification flow during login for Azure AD and ADFS connections
---@field revoke_refresh_token_grant? boolean Delete underlying grant when a Refresh Token is revoked via the Authentication API.
---@field dashboard_log_streams_next? boolean Enables beta access to log streaming changes
---@field dashboard_insights_view? boolean Deprecated. This flag has no effect and is retained only for backward compatibility
---@field disable_fields_map_fix? boolean Disables SAML fields map fix for bad mappings with repeated attributes
---@field mfa_show_factor_list_on_enrollment? boolean Used to allow users to pick what factor to enroll of the available MFA factors.
---@field remove_alg_from_jwks? boolean Removes alg property from jwks .well-known endpoint
---@field improved_signup_bot_detection_in_classic? boolean Improves bot detection during signup in classic universal login
---@field genai_trial? boolean This tenant signed up for the Auth4GenAI trail
---@field local_resource_discovery? boolean Whether the Local Resource Discovery endpoint is enabled (true) or disabled (false).
---@field enable_dynamic_client_registration? boolean Whether third-party developers can <a href="https://auth0.com/docs/api-auth/dynamic-client-registration">dynamically register</a> applications for your APIs (true) or not (false). This flag enables dynamic client registration.
---@field disable_management_api_sms_obfuscation? boolean If true, SMS phone numbers will not be obfuscated in Management API GET calls.
---@field trust_azure_adfs_email_verified_connection_property? boolean Changes email_verified behavior for Azure AD/ADFS connections when enabled. Sets email_verified to false otherwise.
---@field custom_domains_provisioning? boolean If true, custom domains feature will be enabled for tenant.

