---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden, NotFound, Conflict.
---@param input auth0.AdvanceExperimentRampRequest
---@return auth0.AdvanceRampResponseContent? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:advance_experiment_ramp(input) end

